{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜解讀APEC(五)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-19-13-41-28AYBNLZuT.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：解讀APEC</p><p>國家主席習近平在APEC發表講話，期望共同踐行真正的多邊主義，推動構建更公正全球治理體系，對中俄美元首會晤有何啟示？對全球大局有何影響？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港創科發展協會創會主席陳迪源</p><p>智明研究所總監許楨</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:43:58.101570+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:27.315493+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:25.289532+00:00","content_hash":"6eb6fd9200a4ab1797d60da0beac94a5d1e3d5d1dcd9bb169af6527ea8f1083f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}